{'symbol': 'SBUX', 'date': '2022-11-30 16:05:00', 'title': 'STARBUCKS DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'SEATTLE--( BUSINESS WIRE )--STARBUCKS CORPORATION (NASDAQ: SBUX) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS APPROVED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.53 PER SHARE OF OUTSTANDING COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAYABLE IN CASH ON FEBRUARY 24, 2023 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON FEBRUARY 10, 2023.'}